msgstr "引用 %d 条流"

msgid "%d interfaces"
msgstr "%d 个接口"

msgid "%d online"
msgstr "%d 个在线"

msgid "%d pkts"
msgstr "%d 个包"

msgid "%d pkts (ports)"
msgstr "%d 个包（端口）"

msgid "%d queues active · ECN %s"
msgstr "%d 队列生效 · ECN %s"

msgid "%d queues bound (globally off)"
msgstr "%d 队列已绑但全局未启"

msgid "%d rules active"
msgstr "%d 条规则运行中"

msgid "%d server IPs captured"
msgstr "捕获 %d 个服务器 IP"

msgid "%d signature rules"
msgstr "%d 条特征规则"

msgid "%d signature rules · Custom"
msgstr "%d 条特征规则 · 自定义库"

msgid "%s (%d apps · recommended CoS %d)"
msgstr "%s（%d 款 · 推荐等级 %d）"

msgid "%s Mbps · Connected"
msgstr "%s Mbps · 已连接"

msgid "%s · ID: %s"
msgstr "%s · ID: %s"

msgid "(No match criteria specified)"
msgstr "（未填写匹配条件）"

msgid "(no egress qdisc info)"
msgstr "（无出站队列信息）"

msgid "+ Add App Signature"
msgstr "+ 新增应用特征"

msgid "+%d domains"
msgstr "+%d 域名"

msgid "0 (No extra marking · keep unmatched traffic in lowest queue 0)"
msgstr "0（不额外打标 · 未匹配流量保留最低队列 0）"

msgid "0 (Unlimited, download stats only)"
msgstr "0（不限速，仅统计下载流量）"

msgid "0 (Unlimited, upload stats only)"
msgstr "0（不限速，仅统计上传流量）"

msgid "0 (all 8 priority levels share bandwidth by weight)"
msgstr "0（全部 8 个优先等级均按比重共享带宽）"

msgid "0 = Unlimited (stats only)"
msgstr "0 = 不限速仅统计"

msgid "0 interfaces"
msgstr "0 个接口"

msgid "1 (Gentle · intervenes past half queue, prioritizes throughput & compatibility)"
msgstr "1（温和均衡 · 队列过半温和介入，优先吞吐与日常兼容）"

msgid "1. Centrally manage low-level RTL9617C NIC and forwarding ASIC offload features, kept separate from QoS shaping and queueing."
msgstr "1. 这里集中管理 RTL9617C 网卡与硬件转发引擎的底层加速特性（与限速、排队功能独立开来，避免混杂）。"

msgid "1. Click \"Add\" under \"Per-Device Rate Limiting Rules\" below and select your phone, PC, or TV from the \"Device MAC Address\" dropdown."
msgstr "1. 在下方“单设备限速规则列表”点击“添加”，在“设备 MAC 地址”下拉框中直接选择您的手机、电脑或电视。"

msgid "1. Configure scheduling and rate limits on physical Ethernet ports (LAN1–LAN4) and the PON optical port (pon0) using the ASIC's 8-level hardware priority queues."
msgstr "1. 这里针对路由器背后的物理网口（如 LAN1 ~ LAN4）与 PON 光口（pon0）进行调度与限速控制，开启芯片内置的 8 级硬件优先排队通道。"

msgid "1. During port scans, SYN/ICMP floods, or malformed packet attacks, software firewalls on traditional routers can max out the CPU and drop connectivity. With this master switch enabled, the RTL9617C ASIC inspects and drops all 16 attack types at the physical port front-end with 0% CPU usage."
msgstr "1. 当遭遇恶意端口扫描、SYN/Ping 洪水攻击或畸形数据包时，传统路由器靠 CPU 软件防火墙拦截容易占满 CPU 导致断网；开启本页总开关后，RTL9617C 芯片会在网口最前端直接识别并丢弃以下 16 类攻击包，CPU 占用始终为 0%。"

msgid "1. Easiest setup: click \"Esports Gaming & Voice Anti-Lag\" or \"Work-From-Home & Video Conferencing Priority\" under \"One-Click Scenario Presets\" below to automatically enable small-packet priority, load the app signature catalog, and configure port hardware queueing."
msgstr "1. 最省心用法：直接点击下方【一键套用场景预设方案】中的“电竞游戏与语音防卡顿”或“办公与视频会议优先”，系统会自动开启小包优先、加载应用特征库并配置好网口硬件排队。"

msgid "1. Manage the RTL9617C forwarding ASIC's per-flow policer channels (0–159) and multi-flow shared policer groups (0–63) for precise hardware rate limiting and burst control."
msgstr "1. 本页管理 RTL9617C 硬件转发引擎中的“单连接限速通道 (0 ~ 159)”和“多连接共享限速组 (0 ~ 63)”，用于在硬件层对特定连接或共享分组做精确限速与突发缓冲控制。"

msgid "1. When hardware flowtable offload is enabled, established forwarded packets are switched directly in silicon between ports without reaching the router CPU, so running tcpdump on the router cannot see offloaded traffic."
msgstr "1. 开启硬件加速（flowtable）后，大部分已建连的转发数据包会直接由芯片在网口间转发，不再经过路由器 CPU，因此直接在路由器上跑 tcpdump 看不到已加速的流量。"

msgid "1. With \"L2TPv2 / PPTP Hardware Offload\" enabled, plaintext PPP-encapsulated L2TPv2 (UDP 1701) and PPTP (GREv1) data planes are encapsulated/decapsulated directly by the RTL9617C L3PE dual-header tunnel ASIC, sharply reducing CPU usage."
msgstr "1. 开启「L2TPv2 / PPTP 硬件卸载」后，明文 PPP 封装的 L2TPv2（UDP 1701）与 PPTP（GREv1）数据面会由 RTL9617C 的 L3PE 双头隧道 ASIC 直接硬件封装/解封装，显著降低 CPU 占用。"

msgid "10000 (~10 Mbps)"
msgstr "10000 (约 10 Mbps)"

msgid "100000 (~100 Mbps)"
msgstr "100000 (约 100 Mbps)"

msgid "1000000 (~1000 Mbps)"
msgstr "1000000 (约 1000 Mbps)"

msgid "128 bytes (tiny control / voice frames only)"
msgstr "128 字节（仅极小控制包/语音帧）"

msgid "15 safe protection rules are enabled by default (excluding syn1024, which blocks 80/443 replies). Select any rule here to disable it individually if false positives occur."
msgstr "默认开启 15 类安全防护（不含会误拦 80/443 回包的 syn1024）；如果某一项在您的网络环境中产生误拦，可在此勾选将其单独关闭。"

msgid "16 Attack Protection Rules Status"
msgstr "16 类攻击防护规则状态"

msgid "160 channels total"
msgstr "共 160 个通道"

msgid "2 (Balanced · throttles earlier, balances low latency & throughput)"
msgstr "2（标准平衡 · 较早开始提前降速，兼顾低延迟与吞吐）"

msgid "2. \"Host TX Offload (DMA LSO)\" accelerates heavy local router uploads (such as Samba, web server, proxy, or iperf3 server on the router) by offloading checksumming and TCP segmentation to DMA LSO hardware; the status card verifies live ethtool NIC flags."
msgstr "2. 「网卡本机发包硬件加速」适合路由器本机跑大流量上传（如路由器上的 Samba/Web/代理/iperf3 服务端），由 DMA LSO 硬件计算校验和及分段；状态卡片会同时核验 ethtool 网卡层是否真实生效。"

msgid "2. Choosing a mode: (a) To cap total download speed on a LAN port, select \"Port Download Shaping\"; (b) To let high-priority gaming/voice traffic always go first, select \"Strict Priority Queueing\" (VoQ 7 highest → VoQ 0 lowest); (c) Recommended: \"Hybrid Priority Queueing (ETS)\", e.g., top 3 high-priority queues (CoS 7–5) strict and CoS 4–0 sharing bandwidth by weight. (Note: pon0 hardware PUC supports sp and ets only.)"
msgstr "2. 模式怎么选？① 只想限制某个 LAN 口的总下载速度：选“整口下载限速”；② 想让高优游戏/语音无条件抢先：选“按优先级严格排队”（VoQ 7 最高 → VoQ 0 最低）；③ 推荐预设方案：“高低优先级混合排队 (ETS)”，如前 3 个高优通道（等级 7~5）绝对优先，其余 4~0 通道按比重公平分摊带宽。（注：pon0 光口上行硬件 PUC 仅支持 sp 与 ets 排队调度）。"

msgid "2. For per-device rate limiting, use Per-Device Rate Limiting (which has 96 dedicated reserved hardware channels); the 160 channels and 64 shared groups here are for fine-grained flow-level policing."
msgstr "2. 按设备固定 IP 限速请前往【单设备限速】（芯片额外为其专属保留了 96 个底层通道）；本页的 160 个通道与 64 个共享组主要用于连接级精细限速。"

msgid "2. If a tunnel negotiates MPPE encryption, CCP compression, VJ compression, or IPsec encapsulation, the kernel safely falls back to software processing without affecting connectivity."
msgstr "2. 若隧道协商了 MPPE 加密、CCP 压缩、VJ 压缩或 IPsec 封装，内核会自动安全回退到软件处理，不会影响正常连通性。"

msgid "2. Recommended setup: check \"Enable Hardware Automatic DoS Blocking\" below and click \"Save & Apply\". Safe default flood thresholds (ICMP 1000 / SYN 2000 / FIN 2000) and zero-CPU hardware drop on physical ports (excluding CPU ports) are configured automatically."
msgstr "2. 推荐设置：勾选下方“启用硬件级网络攻击自动拦截”并点击右下角“保存并应用”即可，系统会自动配置安全的默认洪水速率阈值（ICMP 1000 / SYN 2000 / FIN 2000）并仅对物理网口（不含 CPU 口）开启硬件零 CPU 丢弃。"

msgid "2. Smart App Signature Detection: %d app signatures loaded (%s), using dnsmasq nftset to dynamically track domain server IPs + dedicated narrow-port matching with zero ongoing CPU overhead and full ASIC hardware acceleration. Click \"Manage Catalog / Batch Import\" below to add, edit, or import rules freely (applies to direct or proxy-bypassed traffic)."
msgstr "2. 应用特征库智能识别：当前已加载 %d 款应用特征（%s），通过 dnsmasq nftset 自动追踪域名服务器 IP + 专用窄端口识别，零持续 CPU 开销且全程走芯片硬件加速；可随时点击下方【维护特征库 / 批量导入】自由增删或导入规则（注：仅对直连或绕过代理的流量生效）。"

msgid "2. Speed unit conversion: 1000 kbps ≈ 1 Mbps (e.g. 50000 for 50 Mbps, 100000 for 100 Mbps, 1000000 for 1000 Mbps)."
msgstr "2. 速度单位换算：1000 kbps ≈ 1 Mbps（例如：限制 50 Mbps 填 50000，限制 100 Mbps 填 100000，限制 1000 Mbps 填 1000000）。"

msgid "2. To capture packets for troubleshooting, enable \"Hardware Flow Traffic Mirroring\" here: the ASIC mirrors matching offloaded packets in real time to a chosen physical LAN port (LAN1–LAN4), where a connected PC running Wireshark can capture them."
msgstr "2. 排障需要抓包时，可在此开启“硬件加速连接流量镜像抓包”：芯片会把命中的硬件转发流量实时复制一份发往指定物理 LAN 口（LAN1~LAN4），在该网口接一台电脑运行 Wireshark 即可抓包。"

msgid "20000 (~20 Mbps)"
msgstr "20000 (约 20 Mbps)"

msgid "200000 (~200 Mbps)"
msgstr "200000 (约 200 Mbps)"

msgid "256 bytes (recommended · covers most gaming & voice packets)"
msgstr "256 字节（推荐 · 覆盖绝大多数游戏与语音包）"

msgid "3 (Aggressive Low-Latency · earliest intervention to prevent ping spikes)"
msgstr "3（激进低延迟 · 更早介入控队，极度防满载跳 Ping）"

msgid "3. \"Zero-Copy RX (page_pool)\" eliminates full-packet CPU memcpy on receive to lower CPU usage for non-offloaded flows (proxy/VPN/Wi-Fi bridging); \"Multi-Core RX Steering\" pins NI IRQs and distributes PON & LAN receive across CPU cores with RPS+RFS."
msgstr "3. 「零拷贝收包 (page_pool)」消除 CPU 收包时的整包内存拷贝，降低非硬件流转发（如代理/VPN/Wi-Fi 桥接）的 CPU 占用；「多核收包调度」将 NI 硬中断独立绑核并让 PON 光口与 LAN 口均衡利用多核 RPS+RFS。"

msgid "3. Advanced customization: you can also add, edit, or delete rules by LAN device IP (e.g. 192.168.2.100), MAC, or specific game ports in the \"Custom Priority Forwarding Rules\" section at the bottom."
msgstr "3. 进阶自定义：您也可以在底部“自定义优先转发规则列表”中按内网设备 IP（如 192.168.2.100）、MAC 或特定游戏端口自由添加、修改或删除规则。"

msgid "3. Enabling \"Hardware Queue Anti-Bufferbloat (WRED)\" below is recommended to reduce queueing delay under saturation. (Note: NIC TX offload and IPTV multicast offload switches are in Network → Hardware Offload.)"
msgstr "3. 建议同时开启下方“硬件队列防缓冲膨胀 (WRED)”，减少跑满带宽时的排队延迟。（注：网卡发包加速、IPTV 组播卸载等硬件开关已独立至【网络 → 硬件加速与卸载】页面）。"

msgid "3. Hardware DoS Protection and Hardware Traffic Mirroring are now separate pages:"
msgstr "3. 原“硬件级网络攻击防护”和“硬件流量镜像抓包”已拆分至独立页面："

msgid "3. If false positives occur during speed tests, LAN scanning, or NAT traversal, exempt individual checks under \"Exempted (Disabled) Attack Types\" or raise the flood rate thresholds."
msgstr "3. 如在特定测速、内网扫描或穿透场景下遇到误拦，可通过“豁免（单独关闭）的攻击防护项”单独关闭对应规则，或调高洪水包速率触发阈值。"

msgid "3. The router includes l2tp_ppp and pptp kernel modules plus xl2tpd/pppd plugins; once you add and connect an L2TP or PPTP client interface under Network → Interfaces, ASIC slot allocations and flow references appear here automatically."
msgstr "3. 路由器已预置 l2tp_ppp、pptp 内核模块及 xl2tpd / pppd 插件；在【网络 → 接口】新建 L2TP 或 PPTP 客户端接口并拨通后，本页会自动显示芯片槽位分配与流引用情况。"

msgid "3. To monitor real-time speed and total traffic for a device without throttling it, set both \"Upload Limit\" and \"Download Limit\" to 0 (0 = unlimited, stats only)."
msgstr "3. 如果您只想查看某台设备的实时网速与累计总流量、不想限制它的网速，将“上传限速”和“下载限速”都填 0 即可（0 = 不限速仅统计流量）。"

msgid "3. To prevent loopback storms, mirroring to router CPU ports is blocked by the driver. Disable mirroring after troubleshooting to avoid consuming extra port bandwidth."
msgstr "3. 为避免回环风暴，驱动已禁止镜像到路由器本机 CPU 端口；排障结束后建议及时关闭镜像，以免占用多余网口带宽。"

msgid "30000 (~30 Mbps)"
msgstr "30000 (约 30 Mbps)"

msgid "300000 (~300 Mbps)"
msgstr "300000 (约 300 Mbps)"

msgid "32 total (UL + DL)"
msgstr "双向合计 32 个"

msgid "384 bytes (covers larger game state sync packets)"
msgstr "384 字节（覆盖较长游戏状态同步包）"

msgid "4 presets available"
msgstr "4 套预设可选"

msgid "4. \"VPN Hardware Offload (L2TP / PPTP)\" uses the L3PE dual-header ASIC to offload plaintext L2TPv2 and PPTP; \"IPTV Hardware Multicast Replication\" and \"GbE 802.3az EEE Power Saving\" can be enabled on demand."
msgstr "4. 「VPN 硬件加速 (L2TP / PPTP)」由芯片 L3PE 双头隧道引擎直接卸载明文 L2TPv2 与 PPTP；「IPTV 硬件组播复制」与「GE 网口 802.3az EEE 节能」均可按需开启。"

msgid "4. After editing rules, click \"Save & Apply\" (or \"Apply Rules Now\" at the top right). The ASIC takes over rate limiting and accounting immediately with zero CPU usage."
msgstr "4. 修改规则后点击页面右下角“保存并应用”（或右上角“立即应用规则”），芯片会立即接管该设备的限速与流量统计，全程硬件加速不占 CPU。"

msgid "4. The on-chip crypto engine 90500000.crypto (100 MHz) passes self-tests and registers at prio=150; because Cortex-A55 includes ARMv8 CE instructions (prio=300, >2.6 Gbps single-core AES-GCM), the kernel prefers the faster CPU crypto instructions by default."
msgstr "4. 片内加密引擎 90500000.crypto（100 MHz）已完成自检并注册（prio=150）；因 Cortex-A55 自带 ARMv8 CE 指令集（prio=300，单核 AES-GCM 已超 2.6 Gbps），内核默认优先使用更快的 CPU 加密指令。"

msgid "50000 (~50 Mbps)"
msgstr "50000 (约 50 Mbps)"

msgid "500000 (~500 Mbps)"
msgstr "500000 (约 500 Mbps)"

msgid "512 bytes (relaxed small-packet threshold)"
msgstr "512 字节（宽松小包阈值）"

msgid "64 groups ready"
msgstr "64 组就绪"

msgid "8 (all 8 priority levels use strict priority)"
msgstr "8（全部 8 个优先等级均按严格优先级排队）"

msgid "802.3az EEE Power Saving:"
msgstr "802.3az EEE 节能："

msgid "A configuration rule already exists for this port; please edit the existing rule"
msgstr "该物理网口已存在一条配置规则，请直接编辑原规则"

msgid "ASIC Line-Rate Forwarding"
msgstr "芯片级实时转发"

msgid "Accelerated High-Priority Flows"
msgstr "已加速的高优先级连接"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "已生效"

msgid "Active Device Rate Limits & Live Traffic"
msgstr "正在生效的设备限速与实时流量表"

msgid "Active Multi-Flow Shared Policer Groups (0 ~ 63)"
msgstr "活跃的多连接共享限速组（0 ~ 63）"

msgid "Active Per-Flow Hardware Policers (0 ~ 159)"
msgstr "活跃的单连接硬件限速通道（0 ~ 159）"

msgid "Active Priority Forwarding Rules & Hit Statistics"
msgstr "正在生效的优先转发规则与命中统计"

msgid "Active on NIC"
msgstr "网卡已生效"

msgid "Active slots %d/16"
msgstr "活跃槽位 %d/16"

msgid "Active · Re-apply"
msgstr "已开启 · 重新套用"

msgid "Add App Signature"
msgstr "新增应用特征"

msgid "Add LAN devices to configure independent max upload and download speeds (in kbps; 100000 = 100 Mbps). Set 0 for unlimited speed with hardware traffic statistics only."
msgstr "添加局域网设备后，可分别设置它的最高上传速度和下载速度（单位 kbps，100000 = 100 Mbps）。填 0 表示不限制速度、仅开启硬件流量统计。"

msgid "Add rules directly by app category (e.g., mobile games, PC games, video conferencing, download/cloud-drive deprioritize) or by specific app name without looking up port numbers. Per-app rules take precedence over category rules; once enabled, dnsmasq nftset tracks server IPs and syncs with ASIC hardware acceleration."
msgstr "无需手查端口号，直接按应用大类（如热门手游、端游、视频会议、下载/网盘降权）或具体应用名添加规则。单个应用的规则优先级高于大类规则；开启后通过 dnsmasq nftset 自动追踪服务器 IP 并同步芯片硬件加速。"

msgid "Adds no complex port rules; enables only the Smart Small-Packet Priority master switch and LAN1 hardware priority queueing, letting the ASIC automatically detect and prioritize small gaming, voice, Ping, and TCP handshake packets."
msgstr "不添加任何复杂端口规则，仅开启【智能小包优先】总开关与 LAN1 硬件优先排队，靠芯片自动识别游戏、语音、Ping 和网页握手小包并优先转发。"

msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "算法"

msgid "All Categories (%d apps)"
msgstr "全部分类（%d 款）"

msgid "All Disconnected"
msgstr "均未连接"

msgid "All Protocols"
msgstr "全部协议"

msgid "All Ready"
msgstr "全部就绪"

msgid "All disabled"
msgstr "全部未启用"

msgid "All domains and ports are validated and deduplicated; saved persistently to /etc/rtl9617c-qos/app_signatures.json (survives sysupgrade)."
msgstr "所有域名与端口均会做安全合法性校验并去重；保存后持久化于 /etc/rtl9617c-qos/app_signatures.json（升级保留）。"

msgid "All packets entering the hardware flowtable are currently being mirrored to the target port."
msgstr "当前所有进入硬件加速表的连接报文都在向目标端口复制输出。"

msgid "All protocols (TCP+UDP+ICMP)"
msgstr "全协议 (TCP+UDP+ICMP)"

msgid "All-Protocol Mode (prioritize all TCP + UDP + ICMP packets below threshold)"
