msgid "Warning: This hardware rule matches all TCP packets with source port < 1024 and SYN flag set, which drops normal SYN+ACK replies from WAN HTTP/HTTPS/DNS (80/443/53) servers and breaks web browsing! Keep disabled unless in a special LAN-only environment."
msgstr "警告：该芯片规则匹配所有源端口 < 1024 且置位 SYN 的报文，会拦截外网 80/443/53 网站的正常 SYN+ACK 握手回包导致无法打开网页！仅建议在特殊纯内网环境开启，正常上网务必保持关闭。"

