msgid "When enabled, the ASIC copies all hardware-offloaded flow packets to the target capture port selected below. Keep disabled during normal operation."
msgstr "开启后，芯片会将所有处于硬件加速状态的连接数据包自动复制一份发送到下方指定的抓包网口。日常正常使用时请保持关闭。"

msgid "When enabled, the ASIC marks ECN congestion bits in IP headers as queues grow so ECN-capable hosts slow down smoothly with fewer retransmissions (applies to ECN-capable traffic only)."
msgstr "开启后，芯片在队列开始积压时优先在 IP 包头写入 ECN 拥塞标记，让支持 ECN 的设备平滑降速且减少重传（仅对支持 ECN 的流量生效）。"

msgid "When enabled, the L3TE WRED engine keeps high-priority queues lossless (VoQ 5–7) while probabilistically dropping or ECN-marking mid/low-priority queues early, sharply reducing queueing latency under full download load."
msgstr "开启后，芯片启用 L3TE WRED 引擎保护高优队列 (VoQ 5~7 不丢包)，对中低优先级队列按概率提前触发丢包或 ECN 拥塞标记，显著降低满载下载时的排队延迟。"

msgid "When enabled, the RTL9617C forwarding ASIC automatically blocks the 16 attack and malformed packet types listed above (ICMP/SYN/FIN floods, Ping of Death, UDP bomb, stealth port scans, etc.) directly in hardware with zero CPU overhead."
msgstr "开启后，RTL9617C 硬件转发芯片将自动启用上方列表中的 16 类网络攻击与畸形数据包防护（包括 Ping 洪水、TCP SYN/FIN 洪水、死亡之 Ping、UDP 炸弹及隐蔽端口扫描等），在硬件层直接丢弃恶意流量，完全不占用 CPU。"

msgid "When enabled, the router automatically detects small packets and assigns higher hardware forwarding priority, avoiding manual port lookups."
msgstr "开启后，系统会自动识别小数据包并分配更高硬件转发优先级，省去手动一条条查端口配规则的麻烦。"

